// Article 2. Decisions.
#require "1-members.charter".
Module poll(subject) {
  Fact yes Identified by person * subject
  Act vote Actor person Related to subject
    Holds when member(person)
    Creates yes()
  Fact majority Identified by subject
    Derived from majority(yes.subject)
      When Sum(Foreach capital: capital.int When yes(capital.person, yes.subject)) * 2 > total-capital.int
  Fact three-quarters Identified by subject
    Derived from three-quarters(yes.subject)
      When Sum(Foreach capital: capital.int When yes(capital.person, yes.subject)) * 4 >= total-capital.int * 3
  Fact unanimous Identified by subject
    Derived from unanimous(yes.subject)
      When Not(Exists person: member(person) && Not(yes(person, yes.subject)))
}

Placeholder candidate For person
Fact matter Identified by SellTheBusiness
Use poll(candidate) As admission
Use poll(matter) As matter

Bool business-sold
Power admit Actor company Recipient candidate
  Holds when True
  Valid when admission-unanimous(candidate)
  Creates member(candidate)
Power sell-business Actor company
  Holds when True
  Valid when matter-unanimous(SellTheBusiness)
  Creates business-sold()

Clause 2.1 Approved "f73072469ad913965faa8ea15f03e180d8e3f42b2a73b59245c86e2e5217f649"
  Norm "The members vote in proportion to their percentage interests." => admission-vote, matter-vote
Clause 2.2 Approved "f82355c2dbe927a66ce4c06f36d1be8f511908768ab518c9775f6285e97b1b77"
  Definition "An ordinary decision is made by members holding more than half of the percentage interests."
Clause 2.3 Approved "b6c95409ae67b33c8a534dfa0aa4c45155cc1fb0164f20e013bb8b6f5e4e4d64"
  Norm "A decision to admit a new member or to sell the business is made only by all the members." => admit, sell-business
Clause 2.4 Approved "61bd213ddcfd307441229f3981306bc1b3dcbb13d3c5af2fd5a29497793217f7"
  Norm "A decision made without the vote this agreement requires has no effect." => admit, sell-business
.
